{"intent":"build","plan":"Create Simon Says memory game using Uno, 4 colored LEDs with resistors, 4 tactile buttons, and a buzzer.","reply":"Simon Says game assembled with Arduino Uno, 4 LEDs, 4 buttons, and a buzzer.","more":false,"clearExisting":true,"board":"full","parts":[{"ref":"U1","type":"uno","props":{"code":"const int btnPins[] = {2, 3, 4, 5};
const int ledPins[] = {8, 9, 10, 11};
const int buzzerPin = 12;
